.TH BTX-OPEN 1 "September 2026" "BTX 0.34.7" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
btx-open \- preview a btx:// resource URI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B btx-open
.I uri
.SH DESCRIPTION
Bounded dispatcher: exactly one argument, no shell. Prints the canonical
URI, kind, and digest. Never runs inference, mining, wallet, or upload.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR btx-modeld (1),
.I doc/modelnet/resource-uri-v1.md
